    dct:description "ratio_sweep evaluates sigma(k_c) at eight ratios from 8 to 72. The value is negative below the discriminant onset 13.605, approximately zero on the onset, and strictly increasing from 0.062 at ratio 16 through 0.241 at 31.18 to 0.358 at 72. The sweep and the ablation bars are on the comparison figure. Deducted because a and the spiral-arm count are not swept." ;
